Title: NovaTech Systems Acquires BluePeak Analytics
NovaTech Systems acquired BluePeak Analytics for $250 million on 15 October 2026. NovaTech Systems is the acquirer, and BluePeak Analytics is the target company.

Title: Nimbus Cloud Acquires stake in Quarry AI
Nimbus Cloud announced it will acquire a 65% stake
in Quarry AI for $85 million, subject to customary
closing conditions.